   "at": [5, 17],
   "radius": 3,
   "speaker": "SIGNAL HOUSE",
   "text": "Calder, I have lost the hum again. This room is on no plan I have. Stay as long as you like. I will be here."
  },
  {
   "id": "room",
   "at": [24, 17],
   "radius": 4,
   "speaker": "A TIDE-WARDEN",
   "text": "I held the Pier Nine lock the winter the first ships came. A door is held from one side or the other. I chose the side I could see and stayed. You may choose differently."
  },
  {
   "id": "ines",
   "at": [24, 10],
   "radius": 3,
   "speaker": "INES",
   "text": "That is a great deal of words for someone who is not here to hear the answer."
  },
